# Words this crate's names keep although helpers/abbreviations.py in the shared workflows does not
# know them: one lowercase word per line, then why it stays (the source that spells it so, or why
# nobody says its expansion). A line without a reason is refused. Plurals with `s` or `es` follow.
#
# lba  the specifications and every reader say LBA
designware  Synopsys's product name for the controller family, as its databook spells it
dwqereg  OpenBSD's `dwqereg.h`, the register header a test checks the bits against
motorcomm  the vendor of the YT8531 physical layer device, as it spells its name
picoseconds  the unit, spelled out as the naming rules require
reposted  English: a descriptor handed back to the controller again
yt  the first half of the Motorcomm part number YT8531
